   "ocr": "WESTERN DIGITAL CORPORATION NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS — (Continued)"
  },
  "WDC_2019_p91__paragraph_0": {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "bbox": [
    70.0,
    122.7,
    526.6,
    205.6
   ],
   "ocr": "As of June 28, 2019, the maximum number of shares of the Company’s common stock that was authorized for award \ngrants under the 2017 Performance Incentive Plan was 88.7 million shares. Shares issued in respect of stock options \nand SARs granted under the 2017 Performance Incentive Plan count against the plan’s share limit on a one-for-one \nbasis, whereas currently, shares issued in respect of any other type of award granted count against the plan’s share limit \nas 1.72 shares for every one share issued in connection with such award. The 2017 Performance Incentive Plan was \nextended in 2013 and will terminate on August 4, 2025 unless terminated earlier by the Company’s Board of Directors \n(the “Board”)."
  },
  "WDC_2019_p91__title_1": {
   "type": "title",
   "bbox": [
    81.0,
    216.8,
    185.2,
    227.7
   ],
   "ocr": "Employee Stock Purchase Plan"
  },
  "WDC_2019_p91__paragraph_1": {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "bbox": [
    70.0,
    236.7,
    526.6,
    343.6
   ],
   "ocr": "Under the Company’s ESPP, eligible employees may authorize payroll deductions of up to 10% of their eligible \ncompensation, subject to IRS limitations, during prescribed offering periods to purchase shares of the Company’s \ncommon stock at 95% of the fair market value of common stock either at the beginning of that offering period or on \nthe applicable exercise date, whichever is less. A participant may participate in only one offering period at a time, and \na new offering period generally begins each June 1st and December 1st. Each offering period is generally 24 months \nand consists of four exercise dates (each, generally six months following the start of the offering period or the preceding \nexercise date, as the case may be). If the fair market value of the Company’s common stock is less on a given exercise \ndate than on the date of grant, employee participation in that offering period ends and participants are automatically \nre-enrolled in the next new offering period."
  },
  "WDC_2019_p91__paragraph_2": {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "bbox": [
    70.0,
    352.7,
    526.5,
    375.6
   ],
   "ocr": "During 2019, 2018 and 2017, the Company issued 2.6 million, 2.5 million, and 2.3 million shares, respectively, \nfor aggregate purchase amounts of $102 million, $119 million and $105 million, respectively."
  },
